ttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ce9661f-3c3d-46d7-8093-89544d49cc26\" />\n\nAs you can see in the 3rd image, the Connection gets removed.\n\nThis Error has appeared in the Project, while having not been an issue hours before.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\ncreate a UI Button, and a script to a scene. Declare a function test(i : int) , and try to connect the Signal \"pressed()\" from the Button to said function.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nh","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117980/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117980/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}